    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "\"In this timely manifesto, the authors of the New York Times bestseller Rework broadly reject the prevailing notion that long hours, aggressive hustle, and \"whatever it takes\" are required to run a successful business today.\" -- From Amazon.com summary.\n\nFried and Hansson reject the prevailing notion that long hours, aggressive hustle, and \"whatever it takes\" are required to run a successful business today. They believe the answer to better productivity isn't more hours-- it's less waste and fewer things that induce distraction and persistent stress. No matter the size of your company, Fried and Hansson show you what needs to be done-- and how you can do it, too. -- adapted from jacket"
    },
